msgstr "Elimina"

#: GTK3 XDG applications and custom actions
msgid "The historical OpenWith and SendTo directories are ignored. Open With uses XDG/GIO, while extra commands use Custom Actions."
msgstr "Les carpetes històriques OpenWith i SendTo s’ignoren. «Obre amb» utilitza XDG/GIO, mentre que les ordres addicionals utilitzen Accions personalitzades."

#: GTK3 XDG applications and custom actions
msgid "User applications are stored below ~/.local/share/applications and associations below ~/.config/mimeapps.list. Rox-Filer2 obtains the real paths from GLib for the active user."
msgstr "Les aplicacions de l’usuari es desen a ~/.local/share/applications i les associacions a ~/.config/mimeapps.list. El Rox-Filer2 obté els camins reals de GLib per a l’usuari actiu."

